{"id":"56c6d17608ca7c42","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-lem-pcf.md","title":"Possible Cofinality Lemma","display":"lem-pcf — Possible Cofinality Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-pcf","aliases":["58-lem-pcf"],"display":"lem-pcf — Possible Cofinality Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-pcf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-pcf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-pcf — Possible Cofinality Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\kappa)\">\\(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\kappa)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span>（可能共尾性集合，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\Bigl(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\Bigl(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>PCF 作用于正则基数的 progressive 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；progressiveness is written pointwise as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\kappa\">\\(|A|&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in A\">\\(\\kappa\\in A\\)</span>, without an undeclared minimum operator.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> 的定义由上游使用 true cofinality；本引理只陈述 progressive 集上的基本包含、大小上界与最大元定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pcf}(A)$（可能共尾性集合，see [[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|<\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\Bigl(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|<\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1286,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3916","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-lem-pcf.md|58-lem-pcf]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50","0fbfc19800246e77"]}